{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_07_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_07","title":"守護者","storyCode":"SV-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"270b3e18bcd18d3d7f202e5bc86c593006a35b24629080e6c182307a76a383e7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"居民們紛紛走上海灘，聆聽主教的教誨。斯卡蒂終於找到歌蕾蒂婭，歌蕾蒂婭要求她弄清楚心中所想。看著欣喜進食的居民和逐漸逼近的海怪，斯卡蒂找回了深海獵人的使命。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"narration","text":"海灘上已經鋪滿了食物。\n人們的請求得到了大海的回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"鱗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......殼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"多一點，再多一點......塞滿嘴巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"漏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"撿起來，吞下去。更多一點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"帶走。帶回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"帶回去。塞滿身體。塞到塞不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"教士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"教士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們願意暫時停下來。他們抬起頭，望向他們的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟姐妹們，盡情享受你們的早餐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這是對善行的獎賞，只因饑渴與病痛並未擊潰我們，而是令我們更加真摯，更加團結，更加友愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種長篇大論的表演，從一個城市到另一個城市，你竟不覺得膩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"何為表演？將祂的偉岸與仁愛帶到陸上，令無知者領受，我本就樂意之至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們什麼都聽不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的海洋將一視同仁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教慈愛地拍了拍正在努力吞咽的男人的胳膊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，兄弟，將你手上這塊鱗肉分享給你受苦的兄弟。你要相信，捨下這一小塊，他的滿足會使得你的心靈更加滿足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民C","speakerId":"avg_npc_188","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，你應和你的兄弟道謝，感激他捨下他本可以擁有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你倆站在一起，手握著手，足抵著足，共用彼此的性命，自此你們將更偉大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民D","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"謝......教士......老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"乖孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"約定並不在你與它之間。而是他們和它，經你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"約定？不，約定是雙向的，這些受苦的人還不足以令大海有所求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"他們請求，大海給予回應。而我幫助他們，令他們的聲音能被聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然已將自己當作我們的一部分，你自然清楚規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請原諒我的生疏。我可以換上更貼切的措辭——你將他們的血肉築成通路，從而在教會內部獲得你想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論怎麼說，你沒必要每次現身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎知我要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高人一等的快感很容易使人沉溺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"謬誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"身為海最虔心的造物，我的地位並非偽妄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我站在這裡，只是因我發自真心想救他們。若是沒有我，他們早就化成了這陸上的一灘灘骯髒腐肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"疾病，饑餓，這些具體的敵人，如果還能對抗，便不是最深的苦難。最深的苦難來自人心靈的深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"當人們發現災難已無法對抗，他們無論做什麼都將把自己引向不可避免的衰亡，這才是真正苦難到來之時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"像這樣的城鎮，伊比利亞還有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這片龐大的國土早已支撐不起人們對它的訴求，這裡的人與人卻依舊困縮在各自逼仄的皮囊內，或彼此隔絕，或互相爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您對伊比利亞的關心令人讚歎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你又錯了。我在意人們的苦，而非區區陸上的國境線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"人都是如此，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"囿於自身肉體的限制，難以憑自己的力量打開對自我和對族類的執著，一味地選擇對抗而非理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣下去，再強大的個體都免不了被逐個擊破，苦難終將吞噬每一個角落。你也曾見證，你也曾動搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我說這些，真的有必要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我說的還不夠多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"真知總是值得傳述，無論聽者是否愚鈍如你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，看在這段時間的共事之情份上，不如將這段話作為消磨等待時間的小小娛樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的言語技巧的確非同凡響。難怪沉迷的人這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你仍然無法理解。我比真誠更真誠。我對他們並無訴求，我亦不相信強迫的力量，我只想向他們指出一種新的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"身體的弱小將永遠限制他們的認知。你以為我是在通過言語誘使他們心靈信服，恰恰相反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在令他們的心靈聽從身體最基本的訴求。聖人的訓導能帶來的不過是一時的盲信，肉身的強大才能令他們有資格親眼看見更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"海裡有些生物。它們沒有眼睛，身體微小，無法游動，只能隨著潮汐漂蕩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"它們見到的大海，與我們見到的有多大區別？沒有眼睛的生物又何從領會大海的神聖與深邃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你與你的同僚，你們不知從何處謀取了這層卑劣卻堅硬的皮囊。你們看不見這些弱小的正如何掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"試問誰才是真正的傲慢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"是正在幫助他們的我，還是那些借著危難擴張，利用言語、將真正的絕望替換成虛假的希望，欺瞞、控制悲慘弱者，從而盜取權柄的偽神教徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者——是從來不願意正視海底的愚蠢的你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我將我看見的分享予他們，令他們打開視野，知曉自己仍有真實的希望。他們自己選擇，是同陸地一起衰朽，還是隨大海走向新生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這種可能性將不僅能將他們從饑餓病痛的絕境中解救，同樣也是大海對僵持著耗損著的陸地的慷慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這並非征服，而是理解，是容納。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我向他們指出了路，帶給他們好的生活，最終引他們如我一樣走向真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這便是我偉大的事業。你錯誤的皮囊困住了你的心靈，令你短視，看不見真正的偉大。我將原諒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。或許沉迷的不止有他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，歌手，我們差點來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好多吃的......大家都好餓，總算有吃的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二、三......這些，帶回去，弄碎了，煮湯給佩特拉奶奶喝。今晚喝這個，好不好啊，小長凳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不要直接吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"殼太硬了，會把你的牙弄壞。回去煮軟了再吃呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你也拿一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌、歌手？你還愣著幹什麼呀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂看到了那個叫牆灰的男人。他正跪在海灘上，大口大口吞吃著一切能吃到的。\n他的眼睛紅紅的，淚水早就乾了。\n他很餓。這些人，他們每個人都很餓。\n斯卡蒂鬆開了女孩的手。\n女孩迫不及待地撲進了人群中。她的眼睛閃閃發光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"吃慢些，兄弟，這些都是你的。往前看，這一整片，也終將都是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，打開心靈，接受自己，擁抱他人，學會相信，懂得犧牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"紛爭早已終結，苦難也會遠去。我們站在一起，我們的心靈、肉體與信仰都將愈發強韌，就如我們足下這片永恆的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請容許我走遠些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對近日某些......飲食消化不良。我或許會忍耐不住，吐在你臉上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"——兄弟，你的貝殼掉了，讓你的兄弟替你拿著吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"真有趣。你今天心情不錯。你甚至對我使用了這樣的詞句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨你怎麼說，請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"來自大海的訊息令你振奮。你等不及我們的盛會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"那就去吧，去尋她。找到你的故交，將這份喜悅分享予她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂飛快地穿過人群。她的眼裡只有那一個人。\n那個人也彷彿正在等她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過來。你看他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聞到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂從懷裡摸出貝殼。\n她拿著貝殼，全力刺向歌蕾蒂婭。\n彷彿早有預料，歌蕾蒂婭沒有躲。\n貝殼刺中了她的手，什麼痕跡都沒有留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的姿勢不夠優美。我教你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭一手將貝殼壓在斯卡蒂胸前，將她壓在牆邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你跳過幾次舞，斯卡蒂？兩次，還是三次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個好舞伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很關心她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她現在還算安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要那些無用的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真懷疑陸上的日子磨壞了你的鼻子，獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上全是臭味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比你更想吐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她確實和你在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你的鼻子還不算太壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，你還沒像一個哭哭啼啼的陸生幼崽一樣，纏著我問個不停，問我為什麼要帶走她，又為什麼在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問問題從來不是我們的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你還是不是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你的心裡還是有許多疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定的話，還是不要動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則，你就只是在給敵人機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的目標不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你來這裡，是想做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直想找她。找到她，你的疑問就能消失嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的記憶壞了。她並不能告訴我什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧你的模樣。也就比困在籠子裡的好上那麼一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我再教你一些，雖然你不是我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記住，獵人追逐獵物，而不是沉迷追逐本身。盲目的追逐只能帶來心理安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經軟弱到渴望這些虛無的幻覺了嗎，斯卡蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你多久沒跳舞了？你走的路太多，你的皮膚很乾燥。你也許已經遺忘了呼吸的節奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再問你一次。你來這裡，是來做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂看向主教。\n主教離得並不遠。他的目光穿過人群，也看向斯卡蒂。\n斯卡蒂握緊箱子的把手。\n主教的臉上露出了一個禮貌且和善的微笑。他指了指某個方向，做出一個邀請的手勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不動手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是一起的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒那麼在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在乎的是你。是你要解開心結，不是我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"懷抱著食物的居民們一個個地走過主教的身邊。他們與他打著招呼，彷彿他們真的是兄弟，真的是朋友。\n——就像一個普通的伊比利亞小鎮會有的每一個午後。\n斯卡蒂的手漸漸放鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和我裝神弄鬼？他是什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了你就會信嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂看向山上的教堂。\n下方，主教正與居民們揮手告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......呃呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"慢慢來，別摔倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到了嗎？這海浪的身影。噗通，噗通，噗通，就像你我的心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你們食的、飲的皆是大海的饋贈。兄弟，你是否感覺到充沛的力量，正從口腹湧來，流通手腳，抵達心臟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"擁抱你們面前的浩瀚吧！這是新生的希望！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂看向岸上的人群。\n人們開始散去。女孩撿了滿滿一筐海貨。她終於抬起頭，茫然地在空蕩蕩的岸上尋找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，歌手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"一眨眼，她又不見了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。歌手認得路，她可能又去找她的同伴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走吧，長凳，帶上這些吃的，回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"長凳，我好想唱歌。我們唱歌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手唱的歌。你還記得嗎？你記得也沒用。你連話都還不會說。這樣吧，我唱給你聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"他的家鄉在後♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"他的路在身前♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿......呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"別撓我。唉。你覺得難聽對不對？我也覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我比歌手差遠啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，多唱幾次，我也會唱好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼......他的路在身前......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要走了。再不走他會起疑心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊長！你到底在盤算什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是需要隊友？你需要隊友的話，為什麼不說？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛你是敵人？如果你是敵人，剛才我想用貝殼了結你的時候，你為什麼沒有反過來殺了我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭搖了搖頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先弄清楚自己要什麼。彷徨的獵人連陷阱都辨別不出。不明不白地成為別人的收獲，這是你想要的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你的眼神，好像有點變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前看我們的時候，和看那些海裡來的怪物，都沒什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，你願意教我做海藻酒，還願意為我們唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們和怪物，當然不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物才不會纏著要我唱歌。怪物連說話都不會。它們通常又髒又蠢，只知道進食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那些海裡的怪物，它們會吃了我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它們餓的話，會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"它們爬上來，就和我們去海裡一樣，都是為了找吃的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你同情怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"餓著肚子，確實難受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給它們吃掉的人就不會這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我也不想就這樣被怪物吃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我沒想過。現在，呃，我還想......再多聽歌手唱一會歌。我還要教小長凳唱，就像佩特拉奶奶教會我的那麼多事一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可得和你奶奶一樣，活久一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！至少現在，我一點都不擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"因為......歌手，你還在這裡，你會幫我們，砰砰砰把它們都打跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastn"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭走了。\n斯卡蒂看向海面的下方。\n不同於一天前的死寂，裡面多了許多活物，它們一個勾著一個，一個疊著一個。最上面的一個，正伸展自己的觸肢，偽裝成海浪的一部分，一下又一下，敲打著岸邊的岩礁。\n山上教堂的門敞開著。\n岸上的人回家了。\n海上的怪物正在“看”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的心跳，在加快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不僅僅是心跳。她看向自己的雙手。只有獵人能看見。她的皮膚在高速震顫，因為承受不住血液的衝撞。\n走調的歌聲來回輕觸她的鼓膜。海裡的氣味不斷刺激著她的鼻腔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。對。是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我畢竟還是個獵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"獵人追逐獵物，獵人狩獵獵物，但深海的獵人會在獵物的尖牙利爪上跳舞，失去了獵伴的獵人當然孤獨。\n自己就是一個獵人，還應該是不要賞金的那種。再逃也沒意義，她所該做的，就是返身走入圍場。\n它們才該怕她。\n到了這時，斯卡蒂才終於原諒了自己。\n斯卡蒂縱身躍向恐魚的潮水。\n臭味。那個教堂中有臭味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
